          "statement": "<p>Suppose \\(f\\) is twice continuously differentiable on \\([0,1].\\) Express</p>\n\\[\\int_0^1(1-t)f''(t)\\,\\mathrm dt\\]\n<p>in terms of \\(f(0),\\) \\(f(1),\\) and \\(f'(0).\\)</p>",
