          "statement": "<p>Let \\(a&lt;b\\) and let \\(f:[a,b]\\to\\mathbb R\\) be continuous. Show that</p>\n\\[\\frac{1}{b-a}\\int_a^b f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\int_0^1 f\\bigl((1-t)a+tb\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm dt.\\]",
