          "solution": "<p>Let \\(F(x)=\\int_a^x f(t)\\,\\mathrm dt.\\) By part (2) of the FTOC, \\(F'=f\\) and \\(F(a)=0.\\) The product rule gives \\(\\bigl(F^2/2\\bigr)'=F F'=Ff.\\) By part (1) of the FTOC,</p>\n\\[\\int_a^b f(x)F(x)\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\frac{F(b)^2-F(a)^2}{2}\n=\\frac12\\left(\\int_a^b f\\right)^2.\\]",
